  teaches: 
  loreText: DOWN HERE THE WATER ROCKS IN SIXES. COUNT ONE-two-three FOUR-five-six. THE BELLS IN THE WATER STING ON ONE AND FOUR, THEN SINK AND BREATHE SLOW. THAT IS WHEN YOU CUT. THE KNIGHTS SWING HEAVY ON ONE. DO NOT CLIMB TO MEET THEM.
